              "value": "Light Pulse"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(evocation, light, primal, visual)\n\n50 feet. The moonflower releases a pulse of bright light. Each non-moonflower creature in the emanation must attempt a 23 Fortitude save. The moonflower can't use Light Pulse again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Failure:** The creature is dazzled for 1d4 rounds.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is blinded for 1d4 rounds."
